["er.request/1",{"arguments":{"body":"## Outcome\n\n`validate --against` a revision without a tree store skips V2 with one line; an `aep.project/3`\ntree store renders `aep.planning-md/2` and an `aep.project/2` store keeps `/1`, with S5 comparing\neach document against the render of its own tag.\n\nDesign: `docs/design/planning-on-entity-runtime-v0.1.md` § 8 and § 13 A5.\n\n## Decisions\n\n- `/2` is the tag change only. § 3.2's `head` key has no defined value and is not written.\n- A `/1` projection of a tree store stays valid until its next write re-renders it; each\n  repository gets one `aep plan artifact render` commit when its planning check moves to the\n  release that renders `/2`.\n","document":{"events":[{"args":{"command":"move-status","decided_on":"{}","target":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","to":"active"},"changed":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790266724349,"id":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/tree-projections-render-planning-md-2","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":3,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790266753126}},"status":"active"},"entity":"aep.entity","from_state":"proposed","id":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","payload":{"actor":"human:timo","at":1790266753126,"causation":"cmd-child-898ae2cdb9ab001d73fe431657c7d132255d0895b138c92e9f4f2f743314924e","correlation":"protocol-artifact-move","event_id":"aep.entity:ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2@3#0~e3259834c03fa3cb","executor":null,"recorded_at":"2026-09-24T16:19:13Z"},"revision":3,"to_state":"active","type":"aep.status.move/v1","version":1}],"fields":{"$aep":{"archived":false,"metadata":{"created_at":1790266724349,"id":"ent-cf6155cda1766ffbc92a724dcf7eafa2","locator":"ep://planning/store/story/tree-projections-render-planning-md-2","provenance":{"created_by":"human:timo","updated_by":"human:timo"},"revision":3,"type":"aep.story/v1","updated_at":1790266753126}},"body":"## Ou